   <media:title>Battery Preconditioning Comes to Older Enyaq Models</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/3ZCWhNJvxT8?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i4.ytimg.com/vi/3ZCWhNJvxT8/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>The latest software update will bring battery pre-heating to earlier Škoda Enyaq models, helping drivers charge faster in colder weather. Available through software version 3.9, the new feature warms the battery to its optimal temperature before rapid charging, improving charging performance when temperatures drop.
In this video, discover how battery pre-heating works, which Enyaq models are eligible, and what additional improvements are included in the latest update.

